 d’amour. Inconsolables, ils décident de vivre en ermites au sommet de trois montagnes.<\/p><p>A chaque anniversaire de la mort d’Irène, les frères allument un grand feu en sa mémoire. Les années passent et, un à un, ils cessent d'illuminer le Mont Saint-Clair, le Rocher de Saint-Guiral et enfin le Pic Saint-Loup, qui portent encore leur nom.<\/p><p>Selon l'artiste, au retour des chevaliers, Irène est bien vivante. Elle a simplement choisi sa liberté. Elle est là sur la face nocturne du Bandou, alors que les trois feux illuminent la nuit.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-primary--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_XFJGVL"]}},"block_order":["accordion_row_TbgNUF","accordion_row_kmdwc8","accordion_row_8a6PCx","accordion_row_Uj3f4F","accordion_row_exVyxz"]}},"block_order":["group_8fkkWP","variant_picker_3Nha6V","buy_buttons_NmYpFG","text_3WaQnM","text_U4tcTQ","accordion_iWQwkW"]}},"settings":{"content_width":"content-full-width","desktop_media_position":"left","equal_columns":true,"limit_details_width":false,"gap":40,"enable_sticky_add_to_cart":true,"color_scheme":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"product_recommendations_UeDczP":{"type":"product-recommendations","blocks":{"text_hT9TEm":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.header","settings":{"text":"<h3>Related items<\/h3>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h3","font":"var(--font-primary--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline